From: Devario packaging <packaging@seafoam-labs.org>
Subject: [PATCH] lib: quirk vendor names resolved from pnp.ids

The hwdb path runs the result through cd_quirk_vendor_name, the pnp.ids
path did not, so the two paths returned different names for the same
EDID and the edid self test aborted on "LG Electronics" != "LG".
---
 lib/colord/cd-edid.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/colord/cd-edid.c b/lib/colord/cd-edid.c
index a5e2328..284760d 100644
--- a/lib/colord/cd-edid.c
+++ b/lib/colord/cd-edid.c
@@ -156,7 +156,7 @@ out:
 			gchar *idx2 = g_strstr_len (idx, -1, "\n");
 			if (idx2 != NULL)
 				*idx2 = '\0';
-			return g_strdup (idx + 4);
+			return cd_quirk_vendor_name (idx + 4);
 		}
 		idx = g_strstr_len (idx, -1, "\n");
 		if (idx != NULL)
-- 
2.51.2

